Compiled terminal descriptions from the ncurses terminal database
(ncurses-base and ncurses-term 6.5+20250216, Debian 13), copied unchanged
as test fixtures: x/xterm-256color, x/xterm-direct (number format 01036),
x/xterm, d/dumb, l/linux, w/wy350 (legacy format 0432).

